# Keep plugin sources byte-stable across platforms: the Host half and the
# browser bundle are read and served verbatim, so normalization must not rewrite them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf

# Binary
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
